      "proof_review": {
        "reviewed": true,
        "context_checked": true,
        "method": "Published author proof/core and local context fidelity screening",
        "note": "Read the complete local dependency chain of Theorem6.9: Proposition5.3 dense-stratum resolution and its dimension reduction; Lemmas5.4-5.5 and Proposition6.1 closed immersion; Lemma6.4 explicit dominating vector construction; Corollary6.5; Lemma6.8 recollement/polystable extension and Cartan bound; and the final closed-point surjectivity proof. Nakajima strata, ordinary GIT, earlier arbitrary-vector Hilbert/quiver correspondence and finite-dimensional recollement extension are identified cited background. The author expressly states the earlier extension proofs do not depend on the dimension vector; no new proof is substituted. Only the reduced cornered-moduli identification is selected, not the elementary framed Quot equivalence or downstream singularity variants. The repeated final definition of K contains a union typo; the same paragraph and Lemma6.8 define K as the complement, and source text is retained."
      },
