      "statement_scope": "Full Theorem6.9 for finite Gamma subset SL(2,C), nonempty I subset {0,...,r}, n_I in N^I and v matching n_i on I with M_thetaI(1,v) nonempty. A=Pi/(b*) for the framed McKay preprojective algebra, A_I=e_I A e_I, eta_I and theta_I exactly (4.2)/(5.1). Enlarge to v_prime in V(n_I) by Corollary6.5 and choose v_tilde_prime by Proposition5.3. The displayed closed immersion M_thetaI(1,v_prime)->M_AI(1,n_I) is an isomorphism of underlying reduced schemes, with the stated commutative resolution diagram. No assertion that the fine moduli scheme itself is reduced is added.",
